**Read:** [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the complete shared gas/dust and chosen metal-family treatment material; [Iron and Steel Production — European Commission BREF](../sources/Iron-and-Steel-Production-BREF.lingua#r_1R9HC6SENF991ZZQA5WKH2C8HD), whole gas/energy/residual accounts for the chosen production route; [Materials, energy, and heat balances in metallurgical processes — Satish Ch. Koria](../sources/Metallurgical-Material-and-Heat-Balances-NPTEL.lingua#r_38NWQRDJH3RVM3NNGB71RR1X43), the complete gas and furnace-account exercises.

Offgas carries mass, heat, momentum, water, chemical species, particles, and sometimes recoverable constituents. Flow and concentration require defined dry/wet and reference-condition bases. Dilution can change a concentration without changing emitted constituent mass; recovered dust may also be an internal circulating load.

Connect the process source, gas path, cooling/heat recovery, condensation, particle capture, chemical treatment, returns, and final streams. Temperature and chemistry changes can alter phase/species, deposit material, cause corrosion/wear, or change what a sampling method measures. An isolated collection-efficiency figure does not describe every operating state.

Track useful recovery and unwanted concentration of impurities through recycles, purges, or secondary products. Gas treatment depends on utilities, consumables, maintenance, instruments, and coordinated work; it is part of production feasibility and product/residual accounting, not an unrelated last-stage addition.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete smelter or steelmaking gas/dust case. Independently balance a consequential element through gas, particles, recovered product, and returns, with compatible measured conditions. Compare an alternative heat/capture arrangement and an interruption or changed-feed scenario. Explain the observations needed to distinguish changed generation, transport, capture, and sampling response. Use actual current primary requirements where a practical study relies on them.

**Continue:** [Explain leaching through mineral reactions, solution chemistry, and the whole feed](../hydrometallurgy/Leaching-speciation-selectivity-and-complete-solution-accounts.lingua#r_2PXCEXY9HNAWMYA9HSZBF4JNH2).

